 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It's midnight, my interview is at ten, and I can't sleep.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.26,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's so normal the night before. Have you prepared what you can?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yes. I've gone over everything like twenty times.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then the preparation is done. Going over it again now will just keep your brain buzzing.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "But what if I forget everything tomorrow?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You won't. Preparation sticks. Try writing down any worries on a piece of paper, then put it away.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.26,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And if I still",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "can't fall asleep?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.37,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Just rest with your eyes closed. Even a quiet, lying down rest helps, and nerves will give you energy in the morning.",
